{"unit_id":"tag:093X:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 为局部化（localization）态射（morphisms）（《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》第 <REF_0001> 节）。由于 <MATH_0003> 是限制（restriction）的左伴随（left adjoint），可知对于任意层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>，作为 <MATH_0005>-模（modules），有 <MATH_0006>。同样，层（sheaf）<MATH_0007> 表示（represents）函子（functor）<MATH_0008>。此外，下面将描述 <MATH_0009>-模（modules）的典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0010>，经由 Yoneda 引理（Yoneda's lemma），它对应于限制映射（restriction mapping）<MATH_0011>（《范畴（Categories）》引理 <REF_0002>）。只需证明所显示的模（modules）的映射（map）是单射（injective），见《同调（Homology）》引理 <REF_0003>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n为构造我们的映射（map），只需构造预层（presheaves）之间的映射（map）；它们给对象（object）<MATH_0012> 在 <MATH_0013> 中赋予 <MATH_0014>-模（module）\n<MATHSEG_0001>与<MATHSEG_0002>，见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0004>。我们取映射（map），它把对应于 <MATH_0015> 的直和项（summand）映到（maps）对应于 <MATH_0016> 的直和项（summand），所用的是 <MATH_0017> 上的恒等映射（identity map）。由于 <MATH_0018> 是单态射（monomorphism），这个映射（map）是单射（injective）。由于层化（sheafification）正合（exact），即得结果。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"represents","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"Yoneda's lemma","target_term":"Yoneda 引理"},{"source_term":"restriction mapping","target_term":"限制映射"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"pre